  "details": "Repro steps:\n1. Join two clients to https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_cea2ef6d-13b3-439a-b876-539bb1691f57\n2. Have the master attempt to rejoin the world (hit go from the world menu)\n3. The master will hang on a black screen\nThis world has three gameobjects which invoke RequestSerialization from OnPostSerialization, thus serializing as fast as they are allowed to by Udon. This appears to result in a hang when leaving the world for some reason.",
